From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Bjorn Andersson <bjorn.andersson@oss.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 23 Jun 2026 01:31:49 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] UBUNTU: SAUCE: dt-bindings: arm: qcom: Add Asus Zenbook A14
 (UX3407NA)

BugLink: https://bugs.launchpad.net/bugs/2167217

UX3407NA is a variant of the Asus Zenbook A14 built on the Qualcomm
Glymur platform. It comes with an 18-core X2 Elite SoC, 32GB DDR, NVMe
storage, a WUXGA OLED screen, and the other typical Glymur platform
capabilities.

Add a compatible for this machine.

[1] https://www.asus.com/us/laptops/for-home/zenbook/asus-zenbook-a14-ux3407/techspec/

Signed-off-by: Bjorn Andersson <bjorn.andersson@oss.qualcomm.com>
Acked-by: Krzysztof Kozlowski <krzysztof.kozlowski@oss.qualcomm.com>
(cherry picked from commit 4bf24d0cc95bac005d82f921ea94586e3a80e2ae https://github.com/linux-msm/laptops-kernel)
Signed-off-by: Tobias Heider <tobias.heider@canonical.com>
Signed-off-by: Paolo Pisati <paolo.pisati@canonical.com>
Ledger-Change: C-00319
Ledger-Origin: ubuntu@dcb067ee4c790523c36c1d3a60781e6f89049fcf
---
 Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
index 77464f3909ca..539e406ffb04 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/arm/qcom.yaml
@@ -86,6 +86,7 @@ properties:
 
       - items:
           - enum:
+              - asus,zenbook-a14-ux3407na
               - asus,zenbook-a16-ux3607oa
               - qcom,glymur-crd
           - const: qcom,glymur
